{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":10,"ref":"2-chronicles 19:10","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"sv","chapter":19,"translation":"Och varje tvist som kommer till er fr\u00e5n era br\u00f6der som bor i sina st\u00e4der \u2014 mellan blod och blod, mellan tora och bud, stadgar och r\u00e4ttsavg\u00f6randen \u2014 dem ska ni varna \u27e8\u05d0\u05ea\u27e9, s\u00e5 att de inte blir skyldiga mot Jahve och vrede inte kommer \u00f6ver er och era br\u00f6der. S\u00e5 ska ni g\u00f6ra, och ni ska inte bli skyldiga.","tokens":[{"surface":"\u05d5\u05db\u05dc","gloss":"Och varje"},{"surface":"\u05e8\u05d9\u05d1","gloss":"tvist"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05e9\u05e8","gloss":"som"},{"surface":"\u05d9\u05d1\u05d5\u05d0","gloss":"kommer"},{"surface":"\u05e2\u05dc\u05d9\u05db\u05dd","gloss":"till er"},{"surface":"\u05de\u05d0\u05d7\u05d9\u05db\u05dd","gloss":"fr\u00e5n era br\u00f6der"},{"surface":"\u05d4\u05d9\u05e9\u05d1\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"som bor"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05e2\u05e8\u05d9\u05d4\u05dd","gloss":"i sina st\u00e4der"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05d9\u05df","gloss":"mellan"},{"surface":"\u05d3\u05dd","gloss":"blod"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05d3\u05dd","gloss":"och blod"},{"surface":"\u05d1\u05d9\u05df","gloss":"mellan"},{"surface":"\u05ea\u05d5\u05e8\u05d4","gloss":"tora"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05de\u05e6\u05d5\u05d4","gloss":"och bud"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05d7\u05e7\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"stadgar"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05dc\u05de\u05e9\u05e4\u05d8\u05d9\u05dd","gloss":"och r\u00e4ttsavg\u00f6randen"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d4\u05d6\u05d4\u05e8\u05ea\u05dd","gloss":"dem ska ni varna"},{"surface":"\u05d0\u05ea\u05dd","gloss":"\u27e8\u05d0\u05ea\u27e9","marks":"dem (era br\u00f6der)"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05dc\u05d0","gloss":"s\u00e5 att inte"},{"surface":"\u05d9\u05d0\u05e9\u05de\u05d5","gloss":"de blir skyldiga"},{"surface":"\u05dc\u05d9\u05d4\u05d5\u05d4","gloss":"mot Jahve"},{"surface":"\u05d5\u05d4\u05d9\u05d4","gloss":"och"},{"surface":"\u05e7\u05e6\u05e3","gloss":"vrede"},{"surface":"\u05e2\u05dc\